---
// BRICKS Brand Development Hub — 비공개 페이지
// sitemap 제외, 네비게이션 미노출
// Updated: 2026-06-02 — 컨셉 브랜드 포지셔닝 + 하이엔드 + 동양 전돌 헤리티지
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>BRICKS — Brand Development Hub</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bk-bg: #0b0a09;
      --bk-surface: #141210;
      --bk-card: rgba(180,120,70,0.04);
      --bk-card-border: rgba(180,120,70,0.10);
      --bk-card-hover: rgba(180,120,70,0.16);
      --bk-brick: #C65D3E;
      --bk-brick-light: #D4785E;
      --bk-warm: #E8A87C;
      --bk-sand: #F5E6D3;
      --bk-gold: #C9A96E;
      --bk-celadon: #7BA298;
      --bk-text: #E8E4DF;
      --bk-muted: #8A8279;
      --bk-dim: #5A544D;
      --bk-input-bg: #110F0D;
      --bk-input-border: #2A2520;
      --font-display: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body: 'Noto Sans KR', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }

    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--bk-bg);
      color: var(--bk-text);
      line-height: 1.8;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Grain overlay */
    body::before {
      content:'';
      position:fixed; inset:0;
      opacity: 0.025;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 512 512' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.75' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events:none;
      z-index:9999;
    }

    ::selection {
      background: rgba(198,93,62,0.35);
      color: var(--bk-sand);
    }

    /* ===== GATE ===== */
    #gate {
      position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:1000;
      background: var(--bk-bg);
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column;
      gap: 28px;
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease, visibility 0.6s;
    }
    #gate.hidden { opacity:0; visibility:hidden; pointer-events:none; }

    .gate-brick {
      width: 120px; height: 60px;
      border: 2px solid var(--bk-brick);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .gate-brick::before {
      content: 'N\b0 01';
      position: absolute; bottom: 4px; right: 6px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px;
      color: var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .gate-brand {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 28px;
      color: var(--bk-brick);
      letter-spacing: 8px;
    }
    .gate-sub {
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 5px;
      color: var(--bk-dim); text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: -12px;
    }
    .gate-input-wrap {
      display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;
    }
    .gate-input-wrap input {
      width:220px; padding:12px 16px;
      border:1px solid var(--bk-input-border); border-radius:2px;
      background:var(--bk-input-bg); color:var(--bk-text);
      font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:14px; outline:none;
      transition:border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .gate-input-wrap input:focus { border-color:var(--bk-brick); }
    .gate-input-wrap input::placeholder { color:var(--bk-dim); }
    .gate-input-wrap button {
      padding:12px 20px; background:var(--bk-brick); color:#fff;
      border:none; border-radius:2px; font-family:var(--font-body);
      font-size:14px; font-weight:500; cursor:pointer;
      transition:background 0.2s;
    }
    .gate-input-wrap button:hover { background:var(--bk-brick-light); }
    .gate-error { font-size:12px; color:#c0392b; height:16px; }

    /* ===== APP ===== */
    #app { display:none; }
    #app.active { display:block; }

    /* ===== NAV ===== */
    .top-bar {
      position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100;
      background:rgba(11,10,9,0.88);
      backdrop-filter:blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(24px);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(180,120,70,0.06);
      padding:14px 40px;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    }
    .top-bar-left { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; }
    .top-bar .logo-text {
      font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:18px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); letter-spacing:6px;
    }
    .top-bar .badge {
      font-size:9px; letter-spacing:2px; color:var(--bk-dim);
      background:rgba(180,120,70,0.08); padding:4px 10px;
      border-radius:2px; text-transform:uppercase;
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
    }
    .top-bar-right { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
    .author-select {
      padding:6px 12px; background:var(--bk-input-bg);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-input-border); border-radius:2px;
      color:var(--bk-text); font-family:var(--font-body);
      font-size:13px; cursor:pointer; outline:none;
    }
    .author-select:focus { border-color:var(--bk-brick); }
    .tool-btn {
      padding:6px 14px; background:transparent;
      border:1px solid var(--bk-input-border); border-radius:2px;
      color:var(--bk-muted); font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:11px; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;
      letter-spacing:1px;
    }
    .tool-btn:hover { border-color:var(--bk-brick); color:var(--bk-brick); }

    /* ===== HERO ===== */
    .hero {
      text-align:center;
      padding:140px 40px 100px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content:'';
      position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
      width:600px; height:600px;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(198,93,62,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    /* Animated floating bricks */
    .hero-bricks {
      position:absolute; inset:0;
      pointer-events:none; overflow:hidden;
    }
    .hero-bricks .float-brick {
      position:absolute;
      border:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.08);
      animation: floatUp 20s linear infinite;
      opacity:0;
    }
    @keyframes floatUp {
      0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(100px) rotate(0deg); }
      10% { opacity:1; }
      90% { opacity:1; }
      100% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-800px) rotate(8deg); }
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:clamp(64px, 12vw, 120px);
      color:var(--bk-brick);
      letter-spacing:16px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
      position:relative;
    }
    .hero .tagline {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:22px; font-style:italic;
      color:var(--bk-muted); letter-spacing:3px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .hero .tagline-kr {
      font-size:14px; color:var(--bk-dim);
      letter-spacing:4px; font-weight:300;
    }
    .hero .scroll-hint {
      margin-top:80px;
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing:3px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:0.3;} 50%{opacity:0.8;} }

    /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */
    .section {
      max-width:860px; margin:0 auto;
      padding:0 40px 100px;
      opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px);
      transition:opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
    }
    .section.visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

    .section-num {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:11px; letter-spacing:3px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); margin-bottom:8px;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:4px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:32px; margin-bottom:12px;
      color:var(--bk-text); line-height:1.4;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size:14px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.8;
      margin-bottom:40px; max-width:600px;
    }
    .divider {
      width:48px; height:1px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bk-brick), transparent);
      margin-bottom:40px;
    }

    /* ===== STORY CARD ===== */
    .story-card {
      background:var(--bk-card);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; padding:52px;
      position:relative;
    }
    .story-card::before {
      content:'';
      position:absolute; top:0; right:0;
      width:200px; height:200px;
      background:radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(198,93,62,0.06), transparent 70%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .story-card p {
      font-size:16px; line-height:2.2; color:var(--bk-text); opacity:0.88;
    }
    .story-card p + p { margin-top:20px; }
    .story-card .hl { color:var(--bk-warm); font-weight:500; }
    .story-card .hl-celadon { color:var(--bk-celadon); font-weight:500; }
    .story-card .philosophy {
      margin-top:36px; padding-top:36px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(180,120,70,0.08);
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:22px; font-style:italic;
      color:var(--bk-warm);
      text-align:center; line-height:1.8;
    }

    /* ===== DEFINITION BOX ===== */
    .def-box {
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(198,93,62,0.08), rgba(180,120,70,0.03));
      border:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.15);
      border-radius:4px; padding:44px;
      text-align:center; margin-bottom:48px;
      position:relative;
    }
    .def-box .def-label {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:10px; letter-spacing:4px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }
    .def-box .def-text {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:24px; line-height:1.7;
      color:var(--bk-sand);
    }
    .def-box .def-sub {
      font-size:14px; color:var(--bk-muted);
      margin-top:16px; line-height:1.8;
    }

    /* ===== BRICK VISUAL ===== */
    .brick-demo {
      display:flex; flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center; gap:48px;
      margin-bottom:60px;
    }
    .brick-frame {
      width:280px; height:140px;
      border:2px solid var(--bk-brick);
      position:relative;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      background:var(--bk-card);
      transition:border-color 0.4s;
    }
    .brick-frame:hover { border-color:var(--bk-warm); }
    .brick-frame .brick-content {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:16px; color:var(--bk-dim);
      letter-spacing:3px; font-style:italic;
    }
    .brick-frame .brick-n {
      position:absolute; bottom:6px; right:10px;
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:9px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing:1px;
    }
    .brick-frame .brick-corner {
      position:absolute; top:6px; left:8px;
      width:12px; height:12px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.3);
      border-left:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.3);
    }
    .brick-frame .brick-mark {
      position:absolute; bottom:6px; left:10px;
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:7px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing:2px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }
    .brick-desc {
      text-align:center; font-size:13px;
      color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:500px;
    }

    /* ===== COLLAB GRID ===== */
    .collab-grid {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap:16px;
      margin-bottom:48px;
    }
    .collab-brick {
      aspect-ratio:2/1;
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:2px;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      transition:all 0.4s ease;
      cursor:default;
    }
    .collab-brick:hover {
      border-color:var(--bk-brick);
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(198,93,62,0.08);
    }
    .collab-brick .collab-inner {
      font-size:13px; font-weight:500;
      color:var(--bk-text); opacity:0.7;
      letter-spacing:1px; text-align:center;
      padding:8px;
    }
    .collab-brick .collab-n {
      position:absolute; bottom:4px; right:6px;
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:7px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing:1px;
    }
    .collab-brick .collab-tag {
      position:absolute; top:6px; left:8px;
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:7px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase;
    }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(1) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(198,93,62,0.12), rgba(198,93,62,0.04)); }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(2) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(123,162,152,0.12), rgba(123,162,152,0.04)); }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(3) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(201,169,110,0.12), rgba(201,169,110,0.04)); }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(4) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(180,140,200,0.10), rgba(180,140,200,0.03)); }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(5) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(220,220,220,0.08), rgba(220,220,220,0.02)); }
    .collab-brick:nth-child(6) { background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(100,140,200,0.10), rgba(100,140,200,0.03)); }

    /* ===== SEASON FLOW ===== */
    .season-flow {
      display:flex; gap:0; margin-bottom:48px;
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden;
    }
    .season-step {
      flex:1; padding:28px 20px;
      text-align:center;
      border-right:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      background:var(--bk-card);
      transition:background 0.3s;
    }
    .season-step:last-child { border-right:none; }
    .season-step:hover { background:rgba(180,120,70,0.08); }
    .season-step .step-num {
      font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:9px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); letter-spacing:2px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }
    .season-step .step-icon { font-size:24px; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .season-step .step-name {
      font-weight:700; font-size:14px;
      color:var(--bk-text); margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    .season-step .step-desc {
      font-size:11px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.6;
    }

    /* ===== PRINCIPLE TABLE ===== */
    .principle-table {
      width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;
      margin-bottom:48px;
    }
    .principle-table th {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:10px; letter-spacing:2px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-align:left;
      padding:12px 20px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.2);
    }
    .principle-table td {
      font-size:14px; padding:14px 20px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(180,120,70,0.06);
      color:var(--bk-text); line-height:1.6;
    }
    .principle-table tr:hover td { background:rgba(180,120,70,0.03); }
    .principle-table .cell-change { color:var(--bk-warm); }
    .principle-table .cell-fixed { color:var(--bk-celadon); }

    /* ===== HERITAGE ===== */
    .heritage-card {
      display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:32px; margin-bottom:48px;
    }
    .heritage-item {
      background:var(--bk-card);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; padding:36px;
    }
    .heritage-item .h-region {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:9px; letter-spacing:3px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .heritage-item .h-title {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:20px; color:var(--bk-text);
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .heritage-item .h-body {
      font-size:13px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.9;
    }
    .heritage-item .h-hl { color:var(--bk-warm); font-weight:500; }

    /* ===== SLOGAN GRID ===== */
    .slogan-grid {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap:14px;
    }
    .slogan-item {
      background:var(--bk-card);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; padding:28px;
      transition:border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .slogan-item:hover { border-color:rgba(198,93,62,0.25); }
    .slogan-item .usage {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:3px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .slogan-item .text {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:20px; color:var(--bk-text);
      margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;
    }
    .slogan-item .desc {
      font-size:12px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.7;
    }

    /* ===== CHECKLIST ===== */
    .checklist {
      list-style:none; margin-bottom:48px;
    }
    .checklist .cl-phase {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:10px; letter-spacing:3px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      padding:16px 0 8px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(198,93,62,0.15);
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .checklist .cl-item {
      display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px;
      padding:10px 0; font-size:14px; color:var(--bk-text);
      line-height:1.6;
    }
    .checklist .cl-box {
      width:16px; height:16px; flex-shrink:0;
      border:1px solid var(--bk-dim); border-radius:2px;
      margin-top:3px;
    }
    .checklist .cl-done .cl-box {
      background:var(--bk-brick); border-color:var(--bk-brick);
    }
    .checklist .cl-done .cl-box::after {
      content:'\2713'; display:block;
      text-align:center; font-size:11px;
      color:#fff; line-height:16px;
    }
    .checklist .cl-muted { color:var(--bk-muted); }

    /* ===== POSITIONING GRID ===== */
    .pos-grid {
      display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap:14px; margin-bottom:48px;
    }
    .pos-card {
      background:var(--bk-card);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; padding:32px 24px;
      text-align:center;
      transition:all 0.3s;
    }
    .pos-card:hover {
      border-color:rgba(198,93,62,0.2);
      transform:translateY(-2px);
    }
    .pos-card .pos-icon { font-size:28px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .pos-card .pos-label {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:9px; letter-spacing:2px;
      color:var(--bk-brick); text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }
    .pos-card .pos-text {
      font-size:13px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.7;
    }

    /* ===== DISCUSSION BOARD ===== */
    .topic-card {
      background:var(--bk-card);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      border-radius:4px; margin-bottom:12px;
      overflow:hidden; transition:border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .topic-card:hover { border-color:rgba(180,120,70,0.18); }
    .topic-header {
      padding:20px 28px; cursor:pointer;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
      user-select:none;
    }
    .topic-header:hover { background:rgba(180,120,70,0.03); }
    .topic-header-left { flex:1; }
    .topic-header h3 { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:var(--bk-text); margin-bottom:2px; }
    .topic-header .topic-desc { font-size:12px; color:var(--bk-muted); }
    .topic-count {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:11px; color:var(--bk-brick);
      background:rgba(198,93,62,0.12); padding:3px 10px;
      border-radius:2px; font-weight:600;
      white-space:nowrap; margin-left:16px;
    }
    .topic-arrow {
      color:var(--bk-dim); font-size:16px;
      margin-left:12px; transition:transform 0.3s;
    }
    .topic-card.open .topic-arrow { transform:rotate(180deg); }
    .topic-body {
      max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height 0.4s ease;
    }
    .topic-card.open .topic-body { max-height:3000px; }
    .topic-body-inner {
      padding:0 28px 24px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(180,120,70,0.06);
    }
    .notes-list { margin-top:16px; }
    .note-item {
      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.015);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border-radius:4px; padding:14px 18px;
      margin-bottom:8px; position:relative;
    }
    .note-meta { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .note-author { font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--bk-warm); }
    .note-date { font-size:10px; color:var(--bk-dim); font-family:var(--font-mono); }
    .note-content {
      font-size:14px; color:var(--bk-text); opacity:0.85;
      line-height:1.8; white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-word;
    }
    .note-delete {
      position:absolute; top:10px; right:12px;
      background:none; border:none; color:var(--bk-dim);
      cursor:pointer; font-size:14px; padding:4px;
      opacity:0; transition:opacity 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .note-item:hover .note-delete { opacity:1; }
    .note-delete:hover { color:#c0392b; }
    .note-input-wrap {
      margin-top:14px; display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-end;
    }
    .note-input-wrap textarea {
      flex:1; min-height:56px; max-height:200px;
      padding:12px 16px; background:var(--bk-input-bg);
      border:1px solid var(--bk-input-border); border-radius:4px;
      color:var(--bk-text); font-family:var(--font-body);
      font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; resize:vertical; outline:none;
      transition:border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .note-input-wrap textarea:focus { border-color:var(--bk-brick); }
    .note-input-wrap textarea::placeholder { color:var(--bk-dim); }
    .note-submit {
      padding:12px 18px; background:var(--bk-brick); color:#fff;
      border:none; border-radius:4px; font-family:var(--font-body);
      font-size:13px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;
      white-space:nowrap; transition:background 0.2s; flex-shrink:0;
    }
    .note-submit:hover { background:var(--bk-brick-light); }
    .note-submit:disabled { opacity:0.4; cursor:not-allowed; }
    .empty-notes {
      text-align:center; padding:20px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); font-size:12px;
    }

    /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
    .hub-footer {
      text-align:center; padding:60px 40px;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(180,120,70,0.06);
      margin-top:40px;
    }
    .hub-footer p {
      font-size:11px; color:var(--bk-dim);
      letter-spacing:1px; font-family:var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* ===== TOAST ===== */
    .toast {
      position:fixed; bottom:32px; left:50%;
      transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);
      background:var(--bk-surface); border:1px solid var(--bk-card-border);
      color:var(--bk-text); padding:12px 24px; border-radius:4px;
      font-size:13px; font-family:var(--font-body);
      z-index:9000; opacity:0; transition:all 0.3s;
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .toast.show { transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity:1; }

    #importInput { display:none; }

    /* ===== WIDE QUOTE ===== */
    .wide-quote {
      max-width:100%; margin:0; padding:80px 40px;
      text-align:center;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(198,93,62,0.03), transparent);
      position:relative;
    }
    .wide-quote .wq-text {
      font-family:var(--font-display);
      font-size:clamp(20px, 3.5vw, 36px);
      color:var(--bk-sand);
      line-height:1.8; max-width:700px;
      margin:0 auto;
    }
    .wide-quote .wq-attr {
      font-family:var(--font-mono);
      font-size:10px; letter-spacing:3px;
      color:var(--bk-dim); margin-top:24px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    /* ===== NAV DOT ===== */
    .nav-dots {
      position:fixed; right:20px; top:50%;
      transform:translateY(-50%); z-index:90;
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;
    }
    .nav-dot {
      width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--bk-dim); cursor:pointer;
      transition:all 0.3s; border:none; padding:0;
    }
    .nav-dot:hover, .nav-dot.active {
      background:var(--bk-brick);
      transform:scale(1.5);
    }

    /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
    @media (max-width:768px) {
      .hero { padding:100px 24px 64px; }
      .section { padding:0 24px 64px; }
      .story-card { padding:32px; }
      .top-bar { padding:12px 16px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
      .top-bar-right { width:100%; justify-content:flex-end; }
      .slogan-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .collab-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .season-flow { flex-direction:column; }
      .season-step { border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--bk-card-border); }
      .heritage-card { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .pos-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .principle-table { font-size:13px; }
      .principle-table th, .principle-table td { padding:10px 12px; }
      .note-input-wrap { flex-direction:column; }
      .note-submit { width:100%; }
      .nav-dots { display:none; }
      .def-box { padding:32px 24px; }
      .def-box .def-text { font-size:20px; }
      .brick-frame { width:220px; height:110px; }
      .wide-quote { padding:48px 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== PASSWORD GATE ===== -->
  <div id="gate">
    <div class="gate-brick">
      <span class="gate-brand">BRICKS</span>
    </div>
    <div class="gate-sub">Brand Development Hub</div>
    <div class="gate-input-wrap">
      <input type="password" id="gatePassword" placeholder="Access code" autocomplete="off">
      <button id="gateSubmit">Enter</button>
    </div>
    <div class="gate-error" id="gateError"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== MAIN ===== -->
  <div id="app">

    <!-- NAV -->
    <header class="top-bar">
      <div class="top-bar-left">
        <span class="logo-text">BRICKS</span>
        <span class="badge">Internal v2</span>
      </div>
      <div class="top-bar-right">
        <select class="author-select" id="authorSelect">
          <option value="">-- 이름 선택 --</option>
          <option value="이현우">이현우</option>
          <option value="김보림">김보림</option>
          <option value="진민정">진민정</option>
          <option value="곽지윤">곽지윤</option>
        </select>
        <button class="tool-btn" id="btnExport">Export</button>
        <button class="tool-btn" id="btnImport">Import</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- NAV DOTS -->
    <nav class="nav-dots" id="navDots"></nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="sec-hero">
      <div class="hero-bricks" id="heroBricks"></div>
      <h1>BRICKS</h1>
      <div class="tagline">Brick by brick.</div>
      <div class="tagline-kr">벽돌 하나에 마음 하나. 모이면 집이 되고, 집이 모이면 마을이 됩니다.</div>
      <div class="scroll-hint">Scroll to explore</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 01 POSITIONING -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-positioning">
      <div class="section-num">01</div>
      <div class="section-label">Positioning</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">컨셉 브랜드라는 장르</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="def-box">
        <div class="def-label">Brand Definition</div>
        <div class="def-text">
          BRICKS는 시즌마다 컨셉을 새로 짓는 패션 브랜드입니다.<br>
          모르는 사람에겐 그냥 멋있는 옷,<br>
          아는 사람에겐 의미가 담긴 한 장의 벽돌.
        </div>
        <div class="def-sub">
          피스마이너스원이나 스투시처럼 겉보기엔 하이엔드 스트릿 브랜드.<br>
          하지만 아는 사람은 안다 — 저 옷을 입고 다니는 사람에겐 이유가 있다는 것.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pos-grid">
        <div class="pos-card">
          <div class="pos-icon">&mdash;</div>
          <div class="pos-label">Surface</div>
          <div class="pos-text">겉: 하이엔드 패션.<br>사고 싶은 디자인이 1순위.<br>가격에 걸맞은 품질과 희소성.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pos-card">
          <div class="pos-icon">&there4;</div>
          <div class="pos-label">Hidden Code</div>
          <div class="pos-text">속: 숨은 의미.<br>벽돌 모티브, N° 시즌 넘버,<br>알면 더 좋은 비밀.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pos-card">
          <div class="pos-icon">&infin;</div>
          <div class="pos-label">Accumulation</div>
          <div class="pos-text">누적: 마음→집→마을.<br>매 시즌의 콜라보가 벽돌이 되어<br>BRICKS Village를 짓는다.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-subtitle">
        의미를 전면에 내세우는 "착한 브랜드"가 아니다.<br>
        의미는 숨기고, 제품은 드러낸다. 의미는 찾아오게 한다 — 떠먹이지 않는다.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 BRAND STORY -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-story">
      <div class="section-num">02</div>
      <div class="section-label">Brand Story</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">소중한 마음들이 모여</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="story-card">
        <p>
          한 장의 벽돌은 작다.<br>
          하지만 그 벽돌에 <span class="hl">마음 하나</span>가 담기면, 이야기가 시작된다.
        </p>
        <p>
          두 장이 만나면 기초가 되고,<br>
          열 장이 쌓이면 벽이 되고,<br>
          백 장이 모이면 <span class="hl">든든한 집</span>이 된다.<br>
          그 집들이 나란히 서면 <span class="hl">마을</span>이 된다.
        </p>
        <p>
          BRICKS는 그렇게 만들어진다.<br>
          시즌마다 하나의 컨셉으로 집을 짓고,<br>
          집이 모여 <span class="hl-celadon">BRICKS Village</span>가 된다.<br>
          당신이 고른 옷 한 벌, 그것이 벽돌 한 장.
        </p>
        <p>
          무너질 수도 있다. 괜찮다.<br>
          다시 쌓으면 된다. 함께라면.
        </p>
        <div class="philosophy">
          "벽돌 하나에 마음 하나.<br>
          모이면 집이 되고,<br>
          집이 모이면 마을이 됩니다."
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WIDE QUOTE -->
    <div class="wide-quote">
      <div class="wq-text">
        모르는 사람에겐 그냥 멋있는 옷.<br>
        아는 사람에겐, 의미가 담긴 벽돌.
      </div>
      <div class="wq-attr">The Concept Brand</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 03 THE BRICK -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-brick">
      <div class="section-num">03</div>
      <div class="section-label">The Brick</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">기본 벽돌 — 시그니처 폼</h2>
      <div class="section-subtitle">
        콜라보를 담는 그릇. 형(形)은 고정, 안의 표현은 무한. 2:1 직사각형 벽돌 비율. 단색 미니멀.
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="brick-demo">
        <div class="brick-frame">
          <div class="brick-corner"></div>
          <div class="brick-content">Your Story</div>
          <div class="brick-mark">BRICKS</div>
          <div class="brick-n">N&deg; 01</div>
        </div>
        <div class="brick-desc">
          프레임은 절대 바뀌지 않는다. 안만 바뀐다.<br>
          50개의 콜라보가 나와도 이 프레임 안에 있으면 모두 BRICKS다.<br>
          우하단 <strong>N°</strong> 시즌 넘버 — 아는 사람만 읽는 코드.
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px; color:var(--bk-text);">Same Frame / Different Soul</h3>
      <div class="collab-grid">
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">아티스트<br>콜라보</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 01</div>
        </div>
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">전돌(塼)<br>헤리티지</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 02</div>
        </div>
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">IP<br>캐릭터</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 03</div>
        </div>
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">사회공헌<br>시즌</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 04</div>
        </div>
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">브랜드<br>콜라보</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 05</div>
        </div>
        <div class="collab-brick">
          <div class="collab-tag">BRICKS &times;</div>
          <div class="collab-inner">한정<br>드롭</div>
          <div class="collab-n">N&deg; 06</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--bk-muted); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:0;">
        콜라보 파트너 하나하나가 벽돌 한 장이 되어 BRICKS라는 집을 짓는다.<br>
        파트너는 프레임 안만 자유롭게 채운다. 프레임 자체는 <strong style="color:var(--bk-warm);">절대 못 바꾼다.</strong>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 HERITAGE -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-heritage">
      <div class="section-num">04</div>
      <div class="section-label">Heritage</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">전돌(塼) — 동양의 벽돌</h2>
      <div class="section-subtitle">
        벽돌은 서양만의 것이 아니다. 동양에도 수천 년 전부터 고유한 벽돌 문화가 있었다.
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="heritage-card">
        <div class="heritage-item">
          <div class="h-region">Korea &middot; 한국</div>
          <div class="h-title">백제 무늬벽돌과 무령왕릉</div>
          <div class="h-body">
            백제·통일신라는 정교한 무늬가 새겨진 <span class="h-hl">전돌(塼)</span>을 만들었다.
            <span class="h-hl">무령왕릉</span>은 벽돌로 쌓은 전축분(塼築墳).
            연화문(蓮花紋) 벽돌은 BRICKS의 시즌 모티브로 쓸 수 있는 강력한 시각 자산이다.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="heritage-item">
          <div class="h-region">China &middot; 중국</div>
          <div class="h-title">만리장성과 진한(秦漢) 전돌</div>
          <div class="h-body">
            중국은 벽돌 문명의 핵심 지역. 신석기 시대부터 흙벽돌을 썼고,
            <span class="h-hl">만리장성</span>의 상당 구간이 구운 벽돌 구조물이다.
            한자 "塼(전)"이라는 글자 자체가 동양 고유의 벽돌 문화를 증명한다.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="def-box" style="margin-top:12px;">
        <div class="def-label">Brand Code</div>
        <div class="def-text" style="font-size:20px;">
          서양의 Brick + 동양의 塼<br>
          <span style="font-size:16px; color:var(--bk-muted);">
            아는 사람만 읽는 이중 코드. 한자 "塼", 전돌 무늬, 연화문 —<br>
            서양식 brick과는 다른 BRICKS만의 동양적 깊이.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 05 SEASON SYSTEM -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-season">
      <div class="section-num">05</div>
      <div class="section-label">Season System</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">시즌 운영 원칙</h2>
      <div class="section-subtitle">
        한 시즌 = 하나의 집 = 하나의 컨셉. 분기제(3개월), 연 4회.
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="season-flow">
        <div class="season-step">
          <div class="step-num">PHASE 1</div>
          <div class="step-icon">&#9633;</div>
          <div class="step-name">착공</div>
          <div class="step-desc">주제 · 기부처 ·<br>제품 · 콜라보 공개</div>
        </div>
        <div class="season-step">
          <div class="step-num">PHASE 2</div>
          <div class="step-icon">&#9646;&#9646;</div>
          <div class="step-name">시공</div>
          <div class="step-desc">판매 · 참여<br>벽돌이 쌓인다</div>
        </div>
        <div class="season-step">
          <div class="step-num">PHASE 3</div>
          <div class="step-icon">&#9651;</div>
          <div class="step-name">완공</div>
          <div class="step-desc">목표 달성<br>집 완성</div>
        </div>
        <div class="season-step">
          <div class="step-num">PHASE 4</div>
          <div class="step-icon">&#10022;</div>
          <div class="step-name">헌정</div>
          <div class="step-desc">기부 집행 · 투명 리포트<br>한정 드롭</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:40px 0 16px; color:var(--bk-text);">변하는 것 / 변하지 않는 것</h3>
      <table class="principle-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:50%">Season &mdash; 시즌마다 바뀜</th>
            <th style="width:50%">Foundation &mdash; 절대 안 바뀜</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">주제 · 서사</td><td class="cell-fixed">벽돌 한 장의 철학</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">기부처</td><td class="cell-fixed">4단계 시즌 구조</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">제품 디자인</td><td class="cell-fixed">슬로건 체계</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">색 · 비주얼 모티브</td><td class="cell-fixed">투명한 기부 공개</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">집의 모양</td><td class="cell-fixed">마을에 누적되는 방식</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="cell-change">콜라보 파트너</td><td class="cell-fixed">기본 벽돌 프레임</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="section-subtitle" style="margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:0;">
        이 표가 컨셉 브랜드를 지탱하는 헌법이다.<br>
        자유(시즌 변주)와 일관성(불변의 축)이 동시에 있어야 "장르"가 된다.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 06 SLOGAN -->
    <section class="section" id="sec-slogan">
      <div class="section-num">06</div>
      <div class="section-label">Slogan System</div>
